    11→### 1. 피보나치 수열
    12→
    13→```freelang
    14→fn fibonacci(n: i64) -> i64 {
    15→  if n <= 1 {
    16→    return n
    17→  }
    18→  return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2)
    19→}
    20→
    21→fn main() -> void {
    22→  for i in range(10) {
    23→    println("fib(" + str(i) + ") = " + str(fibonacci(i)))
    24→  }
    25→}
    26→```
    27→
    28→**출력:**
    29→```
    30→fib(0) = 0
    31→fib(1) = 1
    32→fib(2) = 1
    33→fib(3) = 2
    34→fib(4) = 3
    35→fib(5) = 5
    36→fib(6) = 8
